  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the garlic. Halve the cherry tomatoes.\n• Slice the cucumber into small cubes. Pick and roughly chop the mint leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-8dbc0e70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine the dill & parsley mayonnaise and Greek-style yoghurt. Season with salt and pepper. Stir to combine. Cut the lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-b4d411ec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium heat. Cook the garlic, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the water and vegetable stock powder. Bring to the boil. Add the couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from the heat. Set aside until all the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.\n• Stir through the baby spinach leaves and mint.\n• Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-fc93ad3e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the cherry tomatoes, cucumber and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.\n• Crumble in the fetta cubes and mix to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-1f9e1cc5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your hands to break each spinach falafel into quarters (don't worry if they crumble!). In a medium frying pan, heat the olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people) over a medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, cook the falafels, tossing, until deep golden brown, 5-6 minutes. Transfer to a plate lined with paper towel. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-be9c9ae8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the couscous, spinach falafel and fetta salsa between plates and top with the dill & parsley yoghurt. Sprinkle with the flaked almonds and serve with the lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60c859db9115bf20c370996c/step-a21c7566.jpg"
    }
  ]
